  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your luck with healing turns mortal wounds into mere scratches.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Lucky Healer<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you spend a use of adaptive luck to use this feat, you may roll twice and select the better result for all healing effects that affect you for a number of rounds equal to one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1). In addition, if a conjuration (healing) effect requires a caster level check, such as remove disease or neutralize poison, you may spend a use of adaptive luck or a use of mythic power to reroll the result of that caster level check.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc74\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
